  ('66T - 1/2in Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-1944', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-1944', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('68T - 1/2in Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-1945', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-1945', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('72T - 1/2in Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-1947', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-1947', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('80T - 1/2in Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-1951', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-1951', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#25 Plate Sprocket - 48T - MAXSpline', 'REV-21-1964', 'ION #25 Sprockets are compatible with the REV ION System and designed for use with #25 Roller chain. #25 Plate Sprockets: Featuring MAXSpline and a 2in bolt circle that patterns outward radially, allowing for bolting to structure easily. #25 Hub Sprockets: Featuring a 1/2in Hex bore or MAXSpline and transfer torque through a shaft. 1/2in Hex - 16 Tooth - Double sprockets available for chain in tube applications. #25 Billet Sprockets: Featuring a 2in bolt circle that patterns outward radially,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-25-Sprockets/?sku=REV-21-1964', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/659/images/3405/25_Sprockets-Family-Hero-FINAL__68666.1733438402.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('#25 Plate Sprocket - 64T - MAXSpline', 'REV-21-1972', 'ION #25 Sprockets are compatible with the REV ION System and designed for use with #25 Roller chain. #25 Plate Sprockets: Featuring MAXSpline and a 2in bolt circle that patterns outward radially, allowing for bolting to structure easily. #25 Hub Sprockets: Featuring a 1/2in Hex bore or MAXSpline and transfer torque through a shaft. 1/2in Hex - 16 Tooth - Double sprockets available for chain in tube applications. #25 Billet Sprockets: Featuring a 2in bolt circle that patterns outward radially,…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-25-Sprockets/?sku=REV-21-1972', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/659/images/3405/25_Sprockets-Family-Hero-FINAL__68666.1733438402.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('20DP NEO Pinion Gear - 8mm Keyed - 10T', 'REV-21-1998', 'The NEO Pinions are used for transferring power from a NEO Brushless Motor or something with a similar matching shaft to a mechanism. These pinions come in three different types; either gear, sprocket, or pulley. The pinion gears are compatible with 20DP gears. The pinion sprocket is used with #25 chain and the pinion pulley is used with GT2 3mm timing belts. These pinions either come compatible with 8mm round shafts with a 2mm keyway or 15T Spline shafts. The 10, 11, and 12 Tooth Pinion Gears…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/neo-pinions/?sku=REV-21-1998', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/588/images/1850/REV-21-0000-Pinion_Gear-Family-FINAL__60560.1612816510.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('Speed Option - Slow - 10 Tooth Pinions for 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore', 'REV-21-1998-PK2', 'This product is a pack of 10 Tooth pinion gears for the 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore. Purchasing a Base Kit, Gear Ratio, and Speed Option are all required to assemble a full gearbox, visit the 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore (REV-21-2190) page to learn more. Kit Contents SKU PRODUCT NAME QUANTITY REV-21-1998-PK2 20DP NEO Pinion Gear - 10 Tooth - 2 Pack QTY 1', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-1998-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/740/images/2969/REV-21-1998-PK2-10TPinion_Gear-FINAL__98496.1664829680.500.500.png?c=2', null, 'rev'),
