  ('1in - 1/2in Hex - Hard - Grip Wheel - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-2024-PK4', 'ION Grip Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, durometers, and bores. Larger wheels contain the MAXSpline bore, but can be adapted to other bores with a separate MAXHub. Wheels with spokes have a bolt circle of #10 clearance holes patterned outward at 1/2in pitch and also have a 3/8in wide nut groove, which removes the need for a wrench when utilizing the holes on the spokes. Multiple wheels can be mounted flush next to each other when more surface…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Grip-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2024-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/667/images/3305/REV-21-2400-GripWheel-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__11415.1716577940.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
