  ('MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Plastic - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2036-PK2', 'MAXHubs are compatible with the REV ION System and provide a way to transfer torque to a MAXSpline bore from shafts of various shapes and sizes. Other hub variants allow for other bores or mount holes to populate within an existing MAXSpline. Specifications MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Plastic OD: 1.375in Width: 0.34in Weight: 5g (0.01lbs) Material: Glass-Filled Nylon MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Aluminum OD: 1.375in Width: 0.34in Weight: 11g (0.02lbs) Material: Aluminum MAXHub - 5mm - Plastic OD: 1.375 Bore:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXHubs/?sku=REV-21-2036-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/696/images/2643/Untitled-4__08050.1692730533.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Aluminum - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2037-PK2', 'MAXHubs are compatible with the REV ION System and provide a way to transfer torque to a MAXSpline bore from shafts of various shapes and sizes. Other hub variants allow for other bores or mount holes to populate within an existing MAXSpline. Specifications MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Plastic OD: 1.375in Width: 0.34in Weight: 5g (0.01lbs) Material: Glass-Filled Nylon MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Aluminum OD: 1.375in Width: 0.34in Weight: 11g (0.02lbs) Material: Aluminum MAXHub - 5mm - Plastic OD: 1.375 Bore:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXHubs/?sku=REV-21-2037-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/696/images/2643/Untitled-4__08050.1692730533.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('2in - 1/2in Hex - Medium - Grip Wheel - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-2043-PK4', 'ION Grip Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, durometers, and bores. Larger wheels contain the MAXSpline bore, but can be adapted to other bores with a separate MAXHub. Wheels with spokes have a bolt circle of #10 clearance holes patterned outward at 1/2in pitch and also have a 3/8in wide nut groove, which removes the need for a wrench when utilizing the holes on the spokes. Multiple wheels can be mounted flush next to each other when more surface…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Grip-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2043-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/667/images/3305/REV-21-2400-GripWheel-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__11415.1716577940.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
