  ('36in CAN Extension Cable - 5 Pack', 'REV-21-2052-PK5', 'The 36in CAN Extension Cable is a 3-pin connector to interface with existing CAN devices. Specifications Length: 36in (3ft) Wire Colors: yellow, green 22 AWG', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2052/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/564/images/3706/REV-21-2052_36inCANCable_Hero-FINAL__14887.1765232054.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics / Cables', 'rev'),
  ('#10-32 Shaft End Screw - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2056-PK10', 'The #10-32 Shaft End Screw is compatible with the REV ION System and is used to retain parts on any ION hex shaft instead of shaft collars. 1/2in Rounded Hex Shafts come tapped with a #10-32 hole. The integrated flange is larger than the outside diameter of the shaft and will keep motion components from sliding off the end of the shaft. Specifications Threads: 32 threads per inch OD: 0.50in Weight: 3g (0.007lbs) Material: Alloy Steel Documentation Introduction to Motion Shaft Collars and Shaft…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2056/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/681/images/2595/REV-21-2056-1032ShaftEndScrew-Iso-FINAL__95339.1649960768.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Hardware & Tools / Specialty Hardware', 'rev'),
