  ('#10-32 Standoff - 3/8in Hex - 36.00in (not tapped)', 'REV-21-2076', '#10-32 Standoffs are compatible with the REV ION System and provide spacing for mounting key items on your robot. These standoffs are tapped on each end for a #10-32 thread and have a 3/8in flat to flat dimension, similar to a #10-32 nut. Specifications Hex Size: 3/8in Material: Aluminum 6061 Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Weights: 0.75in (19.1mm): 3g (0.007lbs) 1.00in (25.4mm): 4g (0.010lbs) 1.25in (31.8mm): 5g (0.01lbs) 1.50in (38.1mm): 7g (0.01lb) 1.75in…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Standoffs/?sku=REV-21-2076', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/680/images/2943/REV-21-2061-2071-10-32Standoffs-Hero-FINAL__93195.1660580019.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('8mm Shaft Spacer - 1/8in - 50 Pack', 'REV-21-2078-PK50', 'The 8mm Shaft Spacer is compatible with the REV ION System and is a convenient way to space pinions and gears along the shaft of the NEO Brushless Motor. The 8mm Shaft Spacer is bigger than the 1/2in Hex Adapter and can help keep components from sliding off the end of the adapter. Specifications OD: 0.56in Width 0.125in Weight: 0.4g (0.0010lbs) Material: POM (Acetal/Delrin) Documentation ION Build System Guide 8mm Shaft Spacer User Guide Onshape Application Examples CAD & Drawings REV-21-2078…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2078/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/673/images/2994/REV-21-2078-8mmShaftSpacer-Hero-FINAL__70718.1666198427.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('#10 Spacer - 1/8in - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2085-PK10', '#10 Spacers are compatible with the REV ION System and are an accurate way to space structural components like plates, brackets, or tubes apart on #10 screws. Can also be used to to space motion components like gearboxes away from their mounting surface. Mix and match various spacer lengths to adjust spacing in increments as small as 1/8in. Specifications Material: Nylon OD: 0.375 Weights: #10 Spacer - 1/8in: 0.19g (0.0004lbs) #10 Spacer - 1/4in: 0.37g (0.0008lbs) #10 Spacer - 3/8in: 0.55g…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-spacers/?sku=REV-21-2085-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/672/images/2836/Untitled-20__68385.1651590731.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#10 Spacer - 1/4in - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2086-PK10', '#10 Spacers are compatible with the REV ION System and are an accurate way to space structural components like plates, brackets, or tubes apart on #10 screws. Can also be used to to space motion components like gearboxes away from their mounting surface. Mix and match various spacer lengths to adjust spacing in increments as small as 1/8in. Specifications Material: Nylon OD: 0.375 Weights: #10 Spacer - 1/8in: 0.19g (0.0004lbs) #10 Spacer - 1/4in: 0.37g (0.0008lbs) #10 Spacer - 3/8in: 0.55g…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-spacers/?sku=REV-21-2086-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/672/images/2836/Untitled-20__68385.1651590731.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
