  ('#10 Spacer - 3/4in - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2089-PK10', '#10 Spacers are compatible with the REV ION System and are an accurate way to space structural components like plates, brackets, or tubes apart on #10 screws. Can also be used to to space motion components like gearboxes away from their mounting surface. Mix and match various spacer lengths to adjust spacing in increments as small as 1/8in. Specifications Material: Nylon OD: 0.375 Weights: #10 Spacer - 1/8in: 0.19g (0.0004lbs) #10 Spacer - 1/4in: 0.37g (0.0008lbs) #10 Spacer - 3/8in: 0.55g…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-spacers/?sku=REV-21-2089-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/672/images/2836/Untitled-20__68385.1651590731.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#10 Spacer - 1in - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2090-PK10', '#10 Spacers are compatible with the REV ION System and are an accurate way to space structural components like plates, brackets, or tubes apart on #10 screws. Can also be used to to space motion components like gearboxes away from their mounting surface. Mix and match various spacer lengths to adjust spacing in increments as small as 1/8in. Specifications Material: Nylon OD: 0.375 Weights: #10 Spacer - 1/8in: 0.19g (0.0004lbs) #10 Spacer - 1/4in: 0.37g (0.0008lbs) #10 Spacer - 3/8in: 0.55g…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-spacers/?sku=REV-21-2090-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/672/images/2836/Untitled-20__68385.1651590731.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#10 Spacer - 2in - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2092-PK10', '#10 Spacers are compatible with the REV ION System and are an accurate way to space structural components like plates, brackets, or tubes apart on #10 screws. Can also be used to to space motion components like gearboxes away from their mounting surface. Mix and match various spacer lengths to adjust spacing in increments as small as 1/8in. Specifications Material: Nylon OD: 0.375 Weights: #10 Spacer - 1/8in: 0.19g (0.0004lbs) #10 Spacer - 1/4in: 0.37g (0.0008lbs) #10 Spacer - 3/8in: 0.55g…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-spacers/?sku=REV-21-2092-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/672/images/2836/Untitled-20__68385.1651590731.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('#10 Spacer - 1-1/8in - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2095-PK10', '#10 Spacers are compatible with the REV ION System and are an accurate way to space structural components like plates, brackets, or tubes apart on #10 screws. Can also be used to to space motion components like gearboxes away from their mounting surface. Mix and match various spacer lengths to adjust spacing in increments as small as 1/8in. Specifications Material: Nylon OD: 0.375 Weights: #10 Spacer - 1/8in: 0.19g (0.0004lbs) #10 Spacer - 1/4in: 0.37g (0.0008lbs) #10 Spacer - 3/8in: 0.55g…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-spacers/?sku=REV-21-2095-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/672/images/2836/Untitled-20__68385.1651590731.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('2 Motor Gearbox - Through Bore', 'REV-21-2099', 'The 2 Motor Gearbox - Through Bore is compatible with the REV ION System. This two motor into one(1) output gearbox allows the user to adjust the gear ratio by changing pinion and cluster gear (12:60, 18:54, 24:48, or 36:36). The output shaft is 1/2in Hex through bore, and output gears have a MAXSpline bore. The motor plate contains 2 Pairs of 2in pitch #10-32 tapped holes for mounting the REV Through Bore Encoder, and the output plate contains an array of holes for mounting to structure, as well…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2099/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/743/images/3011/REV-21-2099-Gearbox-hero-FINAL__14235.1670962720.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 3:1 Cartridge', 'REV-21-2101', 'An individual cartridge for the MAXPlanetary System. This cartridge is a 3:1 gear reduction. The MAXPlanetary System is a cartridge-based modular planetary gearbox designed from the ground up for NEO-class motors. The design of the MAXPlanetary has been carefully optimized to provide torque density unavailable in FRC up until now. The MAXPlanetary is intended for use with the NEO Vortex Brushless Motor, NEO Brushless Motor, Falcon 500, Kraken X60, and CIM motors. It also supports NEO 550 and…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2101/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/617/images/3291/REV-21-2101-MAXPlanetary-Cartridge-3-Hero-FINAL__56429.1710776946.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 4:1 Cartridge', 'REV-21-2102', 'An individual cartridge for the MAXPlanetary System. This cartridge is a 4:1 gear reduction. The MAXPlanetary System is a cartridge-based modular planetary gearbox designed from the ground up for NEO-class motors. The design of the MAXPlanetary has been carefully optimized to provide torque density unavailable in FRC up until now. The MAXPlanetary is intended for use with the NEO Vortex Brushless Motor, NEO Brushless Motor, Falcon 500, Kraken X60, and CIM motors. It also supports NEO 550 and…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2102/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/618/images/3294/REV-21-2102-MAXPlanetary-Cartridge-4-Hero-FINAL__35074.1710778602.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 5:1 Cartridge', 'REV-21-2103', 'An individual cartridge for the MAXPlanetary System. This cartridge is a 5:1 gear reduction. The MAXPlanetary System is a cartridge-based modular planetary gearbox designed from the ground up for NEO-class motors. The design of the MAXPlanetary has been carefully optimized to provide torque density unavailable in FRC up until now. The MAXPlanetary is intended for use with the NEO Vortex Brushless Motor, NEO Brushless Motor, Falcon 500, Kraken X60, and CIM motors. It also supports NEO 550 and…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2103/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/619/images/3295/REV-21-2103-MAXPlanetary-Cartridge-5-Hero-FINAL__75170.1710777022.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes / MAXPlanetary System', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 8mm Keyed Input Coupler Kit', 'REV-21-2108', 'These MAXPlanetary Input Couplers are compatible with the REV ION System. The MAXPlanetary 1/2in Hex Input Coupler (REV-21-2110) attaches to the end of a hex shaft, securely held in place by a screw, enabling the MAXPlanetary to be powered by a hex shaft on its input side. Its significance lies in its compatibility with various products, notably the 2 Motor Gearbox - Through Bore and the MAX 180 Degree Gearbox, all designed to drive the MAXPlanetary. Typically paired with a hex shaft, this…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxplanetary-input-couplers/?sku=REV-21-2108', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/820/images/3482/MAXPlanetary_Input_Couplers-Hero-FINAL__44118.1739478661.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes / MAXPlanetary System', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 1/2in Hex Input Coupler', 'REV-21-2110', 'These MAXPlanetary Input Couplers are compatible with the REV ION System. The MAXPlanetary 1/2in Hex Input Coupler (REV-21-2110) attaches to the end of a hex shaft, securely held in place by a screw, enabling the MAXPlanetary to be powered by a hex shaft on its input side. Its significance lies in its compatibility with various products, notably the 2 Motor Gearbox - Through Bore and the MAX 180 Degree Gearbox, all designed to drive the MAXPlanetary. Typically paired with a hex shaft, this…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxplanetary-input-couplers/?sku=REV-21-2110', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/820/images/3482/MAXPlanetary_Input_Couplers-Hero-FINAL__44118.1739478661.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes / MAXPlanetary System', 'rev'),
  ('MAX 90 Degree Gearbox', 'REV-21-2120', 'Designed for use with the REV ION System and with an efficient right-angle configuration, the MAX 90 Degree Gearbox offers a robust and high-performance solution to building a more compact robot. Connect the MAX 90 Degree Gearbox to the MAXPlanetary System in a 90-degree orientation for maximum flexibility and ease of use in tight spaces. The through bore design of the gearbox allows for easy mounting and integration into a wide range of applications. Its 90-degree output orientation provides…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2120/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/759/images/3870/REV_21-2120_MAX90Gearbox_Edited-FINAL_Assembled-Hero_1__80113.1785362885.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / FRC Voucher', 'rev'),
  ('MAX 90 Degree Gearbox Output Shaft', 'REV-21-2120-P01', 'These replacement and interface components are designed to support the MAX 90 Degree Gearbox and its integration with the MAXPlanetary System. The MAX 90 Degree Gearbox Output Shaft (REV-21-2120-P01) provides a direct replacement for a worn or damaged shaft. The MAXPlanetary Spline to 1/2in Hex Adapter (REV-21-2122) allows a MAXPlanetary Gearbox to connect directly to the MAX 90 Degree Gearbox, creating a compact right-angle reduction setup with minimal additional hardware. The adapter can…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAX-90-Gearbox-Spare-Parts?sku=REV-21-2120-P01', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/974/images/3855/REV_21-2120_MAX90DegreeGearbox_ExtraParts_Edited-FINAL__27940.1785261268.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary Spline to 1/2in Hex Adapter', 'REV-21-2122', 'These replacement and interface components are designed to support the MAX 90 Degree Gearbox and its integration with the MAXPlanetary System. The MAX 90 Degree Gearbox Output Shaft (REV-21-2120-P01) provides a direct replacement for a worn or damaged shaft. The MAXPlanetary Spline to 1/2in Hex Adapter (REV-21-2122) allows a MAXPlanetary Gearbox to connect directly to the MAX 90 Degree Gearbox, creating a compact right-angle reduction setup with minimal additional hardware. The adapter can…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAX-90-Gearbox-Spare-Parts?sku=REV-21-2122', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/974/images/3855/REV_21-2120_MAX90DegreeGearbox_ExtraParts_Edited-FINAL__27940.1785261268.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 14T Spline Input Coupler', 'REV-21-2124', 'The MAXPlanetary 14T Spline Input Coupler''s (REV-21-2124) ISO standard 8mm 14T spline is compatible with the Falcon 500 shaft spline. Specifications Material: Steel Weight: MAXPlanetary 14T Spline Input Coupler: 23g (0.051lb) Documentation ION Build System Guide CAD & Drawings REV-21-2124 STEP File REV-21-2124 Onshape REV-21-2124 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2124/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/751/images/3616/2018_source_1722889431__04123.1761842832.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 9:1 Cartridge', 'REV-21-2129', 'An individual cartridge for the MAXPlanetary System. This cartridge is a 9:1 gear reduction. With a 9:1 reduction in a single stage cartridge you will save significant space and weight in your builds that demand the higher reduction! The MAXPlanetary System is a cartridge-based modular planetary gearbox designed from the ground up for NEO-class motors. The design of the MAXPlanetary has been carefully optimized to provide torque density unavailable in FRC up until now. The MAXPlanetary is…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2129/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/816/images/3293/REV-21-2129-MAXPlanetary-Cartridge-9-Hero-FINAL__15756.1710776980.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes / MAXPlanetary System', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 1:1 Brake Cartridge', 'REV-21-2131', 'The MAXPlanetary 1:1 Brake Cartridge is a drop-in, self-contained module that instantly adds a reliable bi-directional unpowered hold for any MAXPlanetary gearbox. Designed around the principles of a sprag clutch, sometimes referred to as a torque diode, clutch, or overrunning clutch, this cartridge prevents backdriving in either direction by locking the output whenever the motor or input is stationary. The brake engages automatically when the output velocity exceeds the motor velocity, and it…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2131/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/922/images/3621/1_1Brake_HERO_Final__37110.1763502507.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes / MAXPlanetary System', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 15T Spline Input Coupler', 'REV-21-2138', 'These MAXPlanetary Input Couplers are compatible with the REV ION System. The MAXPlanetary 1/2in Hex Input Coupler (REV-21-2110) attaches to the end of a hex shaft, securely held in place by a screw, enabling the MAXPlanetary to be powered by a hex shaft on its input side. Its significance lies in its compatibility with various products, notably the 2 Motor Gearbox - Through Bore and the MAX 180 Degree Gearbox, all designed to drive the MAXPlanetary. Typically paired with a hex shaft, this…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxplanetary-input-couplers/?sku=REV-21-2138', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/820/images/3482/MAXPlanetary_Input_Couplers-Hero-FINAL__44118.1739478661.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes / MAXPlanetary System', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary 2:1 Cartridge', 'REV-21-2140', 'An individual cartridge for the MAXPlanetary System. This cartridge is a 2:1 gear reduction. The 2:1 cartridge expands MAXPlanetary ratio options, joining the 1:1 (no cartridge), 3:1, 4:1, 5:1, and 9:1 cartridges. With the addition of 2:1, teams can configure common reductions such as 1:1 all the way through to 10:1 and create more specific ratios by stacking cartridges, making it easy to fine tune mechanisms for the exact speed and torque needed. This cartridge is designed for lower torque…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2140/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/923/images/3759/REV-21-2140-MAXPlanetary-Cartridge-2-Hero-FINAL__41106.1770227134.500.500.png?c=2', 'Shop All', 'rev'),
  ('MAXPlanetary Universal Input Stage V2', 'REV-21-2146', 'The MAXPlanetary Universal Input Stage V2 is a redesigned mounting solution for integrating a wide range of FRC motors into the MAXPlanetary System. Built as the next evolution of the original universal input stage, V2 enhances strength, expands motor compatibility, and enables even more compact gearbox configurations. This updated input stage introduces a new 1.375 inch bolt circle that supports additional motor bolt patterns. CIM class mounting has been clocked to 45 degrees, allowing the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2146/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/942/images/3659/REV-21-2146_HERO_Final__98244.1764944218.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 1x1', 'REV-21-2160', 'MAXTube 1x1 is a versatile, extruded aluminum tubing designed for building strong, reliable robot structures. Fully compatible with the REV ION System, it features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all four sides, simplifying design and assembly. The tubing''s variable wall thickness allows for customized strength-to-weight ratios to suit your design needs. Featuring hole patterns from simple grids to the repeated MAX Pattern every 2 inches, the various MAXTube options streamline…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-1x1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/852/images/3380/REV-21-2160-SquareTube-Hero-FINAL__98596.1732746115.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x1 - Light - 47in', 'REV-21-2161', 'MAXTube 2x1 is durable, extruded aluminum tubing optimized for robot structures and fully compatible with the REV ION System. It features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all 1-inch sides and offers multiple configurations: solid, grid pattern, or the MAX Pattern with MAXSpline cutouts every 2 inches and 0.196-inch holes on a 0.5-inch pitch. With variable wall thickness for tailored strength-to-weight ratios, MAXTube 2x1 streamlines precise, efficient structural design. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x1/?sku=REV-21-2161', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/853/images/3381/REV-21-2185-MAXTube2x1-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__82090.1732749034.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x1 - 47in', 'REV-21-2162', 'MAXTube 2x1 is durable, extruded aluminum tubing optimized for robot structures and fully compatible with the REV ION System. It features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all 1-inch sides and offers multiple configurations: solid, grid pattern, or the MAX Pattern with MAXSpline cutouts every 2 inches and 0.196-inch holes on a 0.5-inch pitch. With variable wall thickness for tailored strength-to-weight ratios, MAXTube 2x1 streamlines precise, efficient structural design. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x1/?sku=REV-21-2162', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/853/images/3381/REV-21-2185-MAXTube2x1-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__82090.1732749034.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x1 - MAX Pattern - 1-Pos (3in)', 'REV-21-2163', 'MAXTube 2x1 is durable, extruded aluminum tubing optimized for robot structures and fully compatible with the REV ION System. It features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all 1-inch sides and offers multiple configurations: solid, grid pattern, or the MAX Pattern with MAXSpline cutouts every 2 inches and 0.196-inch holes on a 0.5-inch pitch. With variable wall thickness for tailored strength-to-weight ratios, MAXTube 2x1 streamlines precise, efficient structural design. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x1/?sku=REV-21-2163', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/853/images/3381/REV-21-2185-MAXTube2x1-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__82090.1732749034.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
