  ('MAXTube - 2x1 - MAX Pattern - 7-Pos (15in)', 'REV-21-2169', 'MAXTube 2x1 is durable, extruded aluminum tubing optimized for robot structures and fully compatible with the REV ION System. It features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all 1-inch sides and offers multiple configurations: solid, grid pattern, or the MAX Pattern with MAXSpline cutouts every 2 inches and 0.196-inch holes on a 0.5-inch pitch. With variable wall thickness for tailored strength-to-weight ratios, MAXTube 2x1 streamlines precise, efficient structural design. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x1/?sku=REV-21-2169', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/853/images/3381/REV-21-2185-MAXTube2x1-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__82090.1732749034.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x1 - MAX Pattern - 11-Pos (23in)', 'REV-21-2173', 'MAXTube 2x1 is durable, extruded aluminum tubing optimized for robot structures and fully compatible with the REV ION System. It features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all 1-inch sides and offers multiple configurations: solid, grid pattern, or the MAX Pattern with MAXSpline cutouts every 2 inches and 0.196-inch holes on a 0.5-inch pitch. With variable wall thickness for tailored strength-to-weight ratios, MAXTube 2x1 streamlines precise, efficient structural design. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x1/?sku=REV-21-2173', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/853/images/3381/REV-21-2185-MAXTube2x1-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__82090.1732749034.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x1 - MAX Pattern - 15-Pos (31in)', 'REV-21-2177', 'MAXTube 2x1 is durable, extruded aluminum tubing optimized for robot structures and fully compatible with the REV ION System. It features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all 1-inch sides and offers multiple configurations: solid, grid pattern, or the MAX Pattern with MAXSpline cutouts every 2 inches and 0.196-inch holes on a 0.5-inch pitch. With variable wall thickness for tailored strength-to-weight ratios, MAXTube 2x1 streamlines precise, efficient structural design. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x1/?sku=REV-21-2177', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/853/images/3381/REV-21-2185-MAXTube2x1-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__82090.1732749034.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x1 - MAX Pattern - 23-Pos (47in)', 'REV-21-2185', 'MAXTube 2x1 is durable, extruded aluminum tubing optimized for robot structures and fully compatible with the REV ION System. It features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all 1-inch sides and offers multiple configurations: solid, grid pattern, or the MAX Pattern with MAXSpline cutouts every 2 inches and 0.196-inch holes on a 0.5-inch pitch. With variable wall thickness for tailored strength-to-weight ratios, MAXTube 2x1 streamlines precise, efficient structural design. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x1/?sku=REV-21-2185', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/853/images/3381/REV-21-2185-MAXTube2x1-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__82090.1732749034.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore', 'REV-21-2190', 'The 2 Motor Drivetrain Gearbox - Through Bore is compatible with the REV ION System and can be mounted in a variety of options, including flush with tube or spaced away from the tube to enable both chain in tube and chain/belt outside tube designs. The user can adjust speed by switching pinion gears on the motor between 10T, 11T, 12T, or can adjust wheel size by switching 2nd stage gear pairs. 2 Pairs of 2in pitch #10-32 tapped holes are available on output shaft for mounting the REV Through…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2190/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/736/images/3014/REV-21-2190-FRCDrivetrainGearbox-Iso-FINAL__64156.1670962718.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('16T - 1/2in Rounded Hex - 20DP Gear', 'REV-21-2196', '20DP Gears are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes and bores. Larger gears feature #10 clearance holes arranged in a 2-inch bolt circle pattern. A notch on the bore provides an easy visual indicator to ensure gears on the same shaft are lined up and in phase with each other. Visit the 20DP Gear - MAXSpline page for more bore options. Specifications Material: Steel 4140 Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 20DP Gears User Guide Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/20DP-Gears-0.5-Hex/?sku=REV-21-2196', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/679/images/3397/20DP-Gears-0.5in-Hex-Hero-FINAL__99081.1733360048.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('RT25 Aluminum Pulley - 8mm Keyed - 1/2in Width - 12 Tooth', 'REV-21-2200', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-21-2200', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('RT25 Aluminum Pulley - 1/2in Hex - 1/2in Width - 12 Tooth', 'REV-21-2201', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-21-2201', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('RT25 Aluminum Pulley - 1/2in Hex - 1/2in Width - 16 Tooth', 'REV-21-2205', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-21-2205', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('RT25 Aluminum Pulley - 1/2in Hex - 1in Width - 16 Tooth', 'REV-21-2206', 'RT25 pulleys pair with RT25 belts to create a power transmission system that matches the exact pitch of #25 chain while aligning with the 1/2in ION Build System pitch. This makes RT25 a drop in alternative to #25 chain and sprockets with the advantages of a belt driven system. RT25 provides the strength and torque capacity needed for drivetrains, intakes, shooters, and other high demand mechanisms while offering lower weight and higher speed capability than chain. Features On pitch with the…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/RT25-Pulleys/?sku=REV-21-2206', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/699/images/3306/REV-21-2200-RT25Pulleys-FamilyHero-May2024-FINAL__59764.1716584345.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Bearing Retaining Plate - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2286-PK10', 'The Bearing Retaining Plate is compatible with the REV ION System and is designed to securely hold bearings in place, ensuring that they remain stable and aligned during use. Made from high-quality, durable materials, the Bearing Retaining Plate is able to withstand the rigors of frequent use and handling. Its simple, yet effective design allows for easy installation and removal, making it a versatile and convenient tool for any robotics project. Features Compatible with MAX Pattern For #10…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2286/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/728/images/3095/REV-21-2286-BearingRetentionPlate-Hero-FINAL__26439.1673990842.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube - 2x1 - Light - Grid Pattern - 47in', 'REV-21-2289', 'MAXTube 2x1 is durable, extruded aluminum tubing optimized for robot structures and fully compatible with the REV ION System. It features #10 clearance holes spaced 0.5 inches apart on all 1-inch sides and offers multiple configurations: solid, grid pattern, or the MAX Pattern with MAXSpline cutouts every 2 inches and 0.196-inch holes on a 0.5-inch pitch. With variable wall thickness for tailored strength-to-weight ratios, MAXTube 2x1 streamlines precise, efficient structural design. Its…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-2x1/?sku=REV-21-2289', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/853/images/3381/REV-21-2185-MAXTube2x1-MAXPattern-Hero-FINAL__82090.1732749034.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('1in Bracket - 30deg - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2291-PK2', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(2) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-2291-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
