  ('MAX Pattern T - MAXSpline Bracket', 'REV-21-2353', 'MAXSpline Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and are designed to mount to pieces of MAXTube - 2x1 - MAX Pattern while maintaining proper pattern spacing. Specifications Material: Aluminum 5052 Weights: MAXSpline Bracket - Stacked: 35g (0.08lbs) MAXSpline Bracket - Offset Mount: 91g (0.20lbs) MAXSpline Bracket - Parallel Top Mount: 49g (0.11lbs) MAXSpline Bracket - MAX Pattern T: 39g (0.09lbs) Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Structure MAXSpline Brackets User…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSpline-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-2353', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/684/images/2941/REV-21-2350-2353-MAXSplineBracket-Hero-FINAL__57139.1660315921.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Lap Joint Bracket - Universal - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2357-PK2', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(17) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-2357-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Lap Joint Bracket - 2in - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2358-PK2', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(18) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-2358-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('Lap Joint Bracket - 1in - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2359-PK2', '1in Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System and feature #10 clearance holes on a 1/2in pitch. Using these brackets with any of our MAXTube or ION Extrusion allows for easy construction of robot frames, mechanisms, and structure. Lap Joint Brackets provide additional versatility by enabling the effortless connection of two tubes in corner configurations or along the length of one(19) tube, creating "lap joints." This added functionality ensures more flexible and efficient assembly for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/1in-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-2359-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/683/images/2841/1in-Brackets-Hero-Final__08533.1651685588.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Bracket - Motor Mount - Flat - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2360-PK2', 'These ION Motor Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System. The ION UltraPlanetary Face Mount Bracket (REV-21-2046) allows for easy mounting of our UltraPlanetary Gearbox to any of our MAXTube products. Each plate features 2x #10-32 tapped inserts for straightforward mounting on any structure. The MAXSpline Bracket - Motor Mount - Flat (REV-21-2360) facilitates quick mounting of motors or gearboxes with a 2in bolt pattern to MAXTubing or structures. It includes a MAXSpline Bore for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Motor-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-2360-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/868/images/3454/ION_Motor_Brackets-Family-Hero-FINAL__60886.1734558475.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Bracket - Motor Mount - Bent - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2361-PK2', 'These ION Motor Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System. The ION UltraPlanetary Face Mount Bracket (REV-21-2046) allows for easy mounting of our UltraPlanetary Gearbox to any of our MAXTube products. Each plate features 2x #10-32 tapped inserts for straightforward mounting on any structure. The MAXSpline Bracket - Motor Mount - Flat (REV-21-2360) facilitates quick mounting of motors or gearboxes with a 2in bolt pattern to MAXTubing or structures. It includes a MAXSpline Bore for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Motor-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-2361-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/868/images/3454/ION_Motor_Brackets-Family-Hero-FINAL__60886.1734558475.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure', 'rev'),
  ('MAXHub - Structural - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2376-PK2', 'MAXHubs are compatible with the REV ION System and provide a way to transfer torque to a MAXSpline bore from shafts of various shapes and sizes. Other hub variants allow for other bores or mount holes to populate within an existing MAXSpline. Specifications MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Plastic OD: 1.375in Width: 0.34in Weight: 5g (0.01lbs) Material: Glass-Filled Nylon MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Aluminum OD: 1.375in Width: 0.34in Weight: 11g (0.02lbs) Material: Aluminum MAXHub - 5mm - Plastic OD: 1.375 Bore:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXHubs/?sku=REV-21-2376-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/696/images/2643/Untitled-4__08050.1692730533.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('Tube Nut - Right-hand Threaded - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2382-PK10', 'Tube Nuts for 3/4in Dead Axle Tube are compatible with the REV ION System. This #10-32 tube nut presses into the end of the tube and supplies a tapped hole for easy mounting. Typically used with dead axle applications. The left-hand threaded tube nut is colored black to help differentiate between right and left. The right-hand threaded tube nut can be used with #10-32 screws to bolt a piece of dead axle tube to a structural component. Generally a dead axle tube is bolted on either side between…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Tube-Nuts-for-3/4in-Dead-Axle-Tube/?sku=REV-21-2382-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/762/images/3092/REV-21-0000-2380-2383-TubeNuts-FamilyHero-FINAL__61326.1673990753.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Hardware & Tools / Specialty Hardware', 'rev'),
  ('Tube Nut - Left-hand Threaded - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2383-PK10', 'Tube Nuts for 3/4in Dead Axle Tube are compatible with the REV ION System. This #10-32 tube nut presses into the end of the tube and supplies a tapped hole for easy mounting. Typically used with dead axle applications. The left-hand threaded tube nut is colored black to help differentiate between right and left. The right-hand threaded tube nut can be used with #10-32 screws to bolt a piece of dead axle tube to a structural component. Generally a dead axle tube is bolted on either side between…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Tube-Nuts-for-3/4in-Dead-Axle-Tube/?sku=REV-21-2383-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/762/images/3092/REV-21-0000-2380-2383-TubeNuts-FamilyHero-FINAL__61326.1673990753.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Hardware & Tools / Specialty Hardware', 'rev'),
  ('MAXHub - Double Sided - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2384-PK2', 'MAXHubs are compatible with the REV ION System and provide a way to transfer torque to a MAXSpline bore from shafts of various shapes and sizes. Other hub variants allow for other bores or mount holes to populate within an existing MAXSpline. Specifications MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Plastic OD: 1.375in Width: 0.34in Weight: 5g (0.01lbs) Material: Glass-Filled Nylon MAXHub - 1/2in Hex - Aluminum OD: 1.375in Width: 0.34in Weight: 11g (0.02lbs) Material: Aluminum MAXHub - 5mm - Plastic OD: 1.375 Bore:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXHubs/?sku=REV-21-2384-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/696/images/2643/Untitled-4__08050.1692730533.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('3/4in Needle Bearing Carrier - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2385-PK2', 'The 3/4in Needle Bearing Carrier is compatible with the REV ION System and designed for use with the Needle Bearing - 3/4in ID to turn MAXSpline Shaft extrusion into a dead axle roller. Specifications Material: Glass-Filled Nylon Weight: 4.6g (0.01lb) Documentation REV ION Build System Documentation Introduction to Motion Needle Bearing and Needle Bearing Carrier User Guide Dead Axle Application Example Onshape Application Examples CAD & Drawings REV-21-2385 STEP File REV-21-2385 Onshape…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2385/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/700/images/2826/REV-21-2385-NeedleBearingCarrierFINAL__74021.1651267700.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Hardware & Tools / Specialty Hardware', 'rev'),
  ('Needle Bearing - 3/4in ID', 'REV-21-2386', 'Bearings 15T Spline Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack (REV-21-3294-PK4) Featuring a 8mm internal diameter and a 1.125in outer diameter, this bearing is designed to fit into a MAXSpline bore while supporting a 15T Spline shaft. The flange adds a way to retain it in place while this bearing supports high-speed loads from many forms of mechanisms that are driven by a 15T Spline shaft including supporting the end of motor shafts. 1/2in Hex Bearing - Flanged - 1.125in OD - 4 Pack…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Bearings/?sku=REV-21-2386', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/871/images/3433/ION_Bearings-Family-Hero-FINAL__10655.1733763769.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shaft Endcap - 1/2in Hex - Plastic - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2393-PK2', 'MAXSpline Shaft Endcaps are compatible with the REV ION System and transform your MAXSpline Shaft extrusion into a live axle driven by a 1/2in Hex shaft. MAXSpline Shaft Endcaps come in two different materials: a durable plastic version and an upgraded aluminum version. The aluminum endcaps were developed for teams seeking robust solutions for higher-torque applications. *Please note, these endcaps are for use with the MAXSpline Shaft and are not MAXHubs. Specifications MAXSpline Shaft Endcap…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxspline-shaft-endcaps/?sku=REV-21-2393-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/806/images/3191/REV-21-0000-MAXSplineShaftEndCap-FamilyHero-FINAL__00123.1701876940.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('External Retaining Ring - 3/4in - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2394-PK10', 'The 3/4in External Retaining Ring is compatible with the REV ION System and is used to constrain movement on the Dead Axle Tube - 3/4in for intake and roller applications. Specifications Material: Steel Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion Dead Axle Tube User Guide Application Example - Dead Axle CAD & Drawings REV-21-2394 STEP File REV-21-2394 Onshape REV-21-2394 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2394/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/688/images/2844/REV-21-2394__50367.1650317864.1280.1280__26150.1652130932.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Hardware & Tools / Specialty Hardware', 'rev'),
  ('1in Pivot Joint - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2395-PK2', 'The 1in Pivot Joint is compatible with the REV ION System. Create a pivot joint at the end of a piece of MAXTube - 1x1 with Grid Structure. Specifications Material: POM (Acetal/Delrin) Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion 1in Pivot Joint User Guide CAD & Drawings REV-21-2395 STEP File REV-21-2395 Onshape Onshape Application Examples - Low, Medium, & High Complexity Onshape Application Example - Linear Actuator Arm REV-21-2395 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2395/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/689/images/2642/Untitled-2__96299.1650292781.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Hardware & Tools / Specialty Hardware', 'rev'),
  ('Stepped Bushing - 3/4in ID', 'REV-21-2396', 'The Stepped Bushing - 3/4in ID is compatible with the REV ION System. This bushing used in conjunction with the MAXSpline Shaft and Dead Axle Tube - 3/4in can be used to build robust and effective rollers and intakes. Specifications Material: Bronze Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion CAD & Drawings REV-21-2396 STEP File REV-21-2396 Onshape Onshape Application Examples - Low, Medium, & High Complexity Onshape Application Example - Linear Actuator Arm REV-21-2396 Drawing', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2396/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/690/images/3008/REV-21-2396-SteppedBrushing-Hero-FINAL__28885.1666891504.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Hardware & Tools / Specialty Hardware', 'rev'),
  ('2in - MAXSpline - Hard - Traction Wheel - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-2422-PK4', 'ION Traction Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, durometers, and bores. Larger wheels contain the MAXSpline bore, but can be adapted to other bores with a separate MAXHub. Wheels with spokes have a bolt circle of #10 clearance holes patterned outward at 1/2in pitch and also have a 3/8in wide nut groove, which removes the need for a wrench when utilizing the holes on the spokes. Multiple wheels can be mounted flush next to each other when more…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Traction-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2422-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/666/images/2646/Untitled-7__28355.1650296037.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / New Products', 'rev'),
