  ('3in - MAXSpline - Soft - Compliant Wheel', 'REV-21-2452', 'ION Compliant Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, durometers, and bores. Larger wheels contain the MAXSpline bore, but can be adapted to other bores with a separate MAXHub. The radial spoke profile allows for more consistent compliance, and more compression than other compliant wheels. Specifications Compliant Wheel - 2in - MAXSpline Bore: Hubless - Stretch-to-fit MAXSpline Material: Silicone Durometer: 30A (Medium - Dark Grey) Width: 11.1mm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Compliant-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2452', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/664/images/2645/Untitled-6__21982.1650295805.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('4in - MAXSpline - Soft - Compliant Wheel', 'REV-21-2453', 'ION Compliant Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, durometers, and bores. Larger wheels contain the MAXSpline bore, but can be adapted to other bores with a separate MAXHub. The radial spoke profile allows for more consistent compliance, and more compression than other compliant wheels. Specifications Compliant Wheel - 2in - MAXSpline Bore: Hubless - Stretch-to-fit MAXSpline Material: Silicone Durometer: 30A (Medium - Dark Grey) Width: 11.1mm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Compliant-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2453', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/664/images/2645/Untitled-6__21982.1650295805.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('3in - MAXSpline - Medium - Compliant Wheel', 'REV-21-2456', 'ION Compliant Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, durometers, and bores. Larger wheels contain the MAXSpline bore, but can be adapted to other bores with a separate MAXHub. The radial spoke profile allows for more consistent compliance, and more compression than other compliant wheels. Specifications Compliant Wheel - 2in - MAXSpline Bore: Hubless - Stretch-to-fit MAXSpline Material: Silicone Durometer: 30A (Medium - Dark Grey) Width: 11.1mm…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Compliant-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2456', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/664/images/2645/Untitled-6__21982.1650295805.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
