  ('SPARK MAX Mounting Bracket - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2468-PK2', 'Mounting your SPARK MAX Motor Controller (REV-11-2158) has never been easier with the help of the SPARK MAX Mounting Bracket. Configured with a hole pattern compatible with a 1/2in grid and allowing the mode and status light to be seen, this bracket is your number one(20) solution to an organized and easily adjustable electrical system. Specifications Materials: ABS Hole Diameter: 0.197in (5.00mm) Weight: 18g (0.04lbs) Documentation ION Build System Guide ION Brushless System Guide CAD & Drawings…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2468-pk2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/647/images/2516/REV-21-2151-SPARKMAXMountBracket-Hero-FINAL__42719.1642015026.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Electronics', 'rev'),
  ('2in - 1/2in Hex - Omni Wheel', 'REV-21-2472', 'ION Omni Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, all featuring the MAXSpline bore. Other bores are possible with a separate MAXHub. Rollers for each wheel size are unique, which ensures perfectly circular wheels. Wheels have a 3-piece hub construction, assembled using self-tapping screws. The outer hub rings are aluminum with dowel pin recessed areas completely within aluminum part for stronger roller retention. Similar to ION Traction and ION Grip…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Omni-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2472', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/665/images/2644/Untitled-5__05138.1650294626.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
