  ('4in - MAXSpline - Omni Wheel', 'REV-21-2474', 'ION Omni Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, all featuring the MAXSpline bore. Other bores are possible with a separate MAXHub. Rollers for each wheel size are unique, which ensures perfectly circular wheels. Wheels have a 3-piece hub construction, assembled using self-tapping screws. The outer hub rings are aluminum with dowel pin recessed areas completely within aluminum part for stronger roller retention. Similar to ION Traction and ION Grip…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Omni-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2474', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/665/images/2644/Untitled-5__05138.1650294626.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
  ('5in - MAXSpline - Omni Wheel', 'REV-21-2475', 'ION Omni Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, all featuring the MAXSpline bore. Other bores are possible with a separate MAXHub. Rollers for each wheel size are unique, which ensures perfectly circular wheels. Wheels have a 3-piece hub construction, assembled using self-tapping screws. The outer hub rings are aluminum with dowel pin recessed areas completely within aluminum part for stronger roller retention. Similar to ION Traction and ION Grip…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Omni-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2475', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/665/images/2644/Untitled-5__05138.1650294626.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
  ('6in - MAXSpline - Omni Wheel', 'REV-21-2476', 'ION Omni Wheels are compatible with the REV ION System and come in a wide range of sizes, all featuring the MAXSpline bore. Other bores are possible with a separate MAXHub. Rollers for each wheel size are unique, which ensures perfectly circular wheels. Wheels have a 3-piece hub construction, assembled using self-tapping screws. The outer hub rings are aluminum with dowel pin recessed areas completely within aluminum part for stronger roller retention. Similar to ION Traction and ION Grip…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Omni-Wheels/?sku=REV-21-2476', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/665/images/2644/Untitled-5__05138.1650294626.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Wheels', 'rev'),
  ('Dead Axle Tube - 3/4in - 36in', 'REV-21-2510', 'Dead Axle Tube is compatible with the REV ION System and can be used with 3/4in Needle Bearing Carrier (REV-21-2385) and MAXSpline Shaft (REV-21-2520) as the dead axle in a dead axle roller. Can also be used with custom rollers and as structural support. Specifications Length: 914mm (36in) OD: 19.05mm (0.750in) ID: 15.88mm (0.625in) Material: Aluminum 6061 Weight: 213g (0.47lb) Documentation ION Build System Guide Introduction to Motion Dead Axle Tube User Guide Application Example - Dead Axle…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2510/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/701/images/2825/REV-21-2510-DeadAxleTube-FINAL__71747.1692730082.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shafts - 47in — MAXSpline Shaft - 47in', 'REV-21-2520', 'The MAXSpline Shaft - (REV-21-2520) is compatible with the REV ION System. The shaft is an extruded aluminum MAXSpline that provides a high strength alternative to 1/2in hex shaft that can interface with any REV ION System components with a MAXSpline bore. The inner diameter is 1in and can fit a Needle Bearing for dead axle applications. The MAXSpline Shaft -Polycarbonate (REV-21-6520) brings the versatility of the MAXSpline profile to lightweight mechanisms where reducing mass is a priority.…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSpline-shafts-47in?sku=REV-21-2520', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/932/images/3880/REV-21-2520-6520_MAXSplineShaft_Family_FINAL__35446.1791303305.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / New Products', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Spacer - 1/16in - 10 Pack', 'REV-21-2540-PK10', 'MAXSpline Spacers are compatible with the REV ION System and can be used on the shaft as a spacer; they also work as spacers between wheels and sprockets, etc. Specifications Material: POM (Acetal/Delrin) OD: 1.50in Weights & Dimensions: MAXSpline Spacer - 1/16in Weight: 0.8g (0.002lbs) Width: 0.063in MAXSpline Spacer - 1/8in Weight: 1.4g (0.003lbs) Width: 0.125in MAXSpline Spacer - 1/4in Weight: 2.7g (0.006lbs) Width: 0.250in MAXSpline Spacer - 1/2in Weight: 5.3g (0.012lbs) Width: 0.500in…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSpline-Spacers/?sku=REV-21-2540-PK10', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/660/images/2813/Untitled-17__42962.1651257163.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
