  ('MAXSpline Spacer with MAX Pattern - 1/4in - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-2547-PK4', 'MAXSpline Spacers are compatible with the REV ION System and can be used on the shaft as a spacer; they also work as spacers between wheels and sprockets, etc. The MAXSpline Spacer with MAX Pattern features a 2in bolt circle pattern. Specifications OD: 2.750in Width: 0.250in Weight: 14g (0.032lbs) Material: POM (Acetal/Delrin) Documentation REV ION Build System Documentation Introduction to Motion MAXSpline Spacer with MAX Pattern User Guide Onshape Application Examples CAD & Drawings…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2547/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/662/images/2613/REV-21-2547-MAXSplineSpacer-MaxPattern-Front-FINAL_1__50566.1649981328.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Motion / Bearings, Shafts, & Spacers', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline 2x1 Bearing Block', 'REV-21-2550', 'MAXSpline Bearing Blocks are compatible with the REV ION System. Quickly add bearing support to any location on REV ION extrusion without the need for precision machining. Can also be used in a west coast style drivetrain to add center wheel drop while allowing teams the ability to quickly move their wheels to their desired position that might not be on MAX Pattern pitch. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Finish: Black Anodized MAXSpline bore Bearing flange pocket #10 screw clearance…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSpline-Bearing-Blocks/?sku=REV-21-2550', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/725/images/2984/REV-21-2550-MAXSplineBearingBlock-Hero-FINAL__99173.1692731088.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline 1x1 Bearing Block', 'REV-21-2551', 'MAXSpline Bearing Blocks are compatible with the REV ION System. Quickly add bearing support to any location on REV ION extrusion without the need for precision machining. Can also be used in a west coast style drivetrain to add center wheel drop while allowing teams the ability to quickly move their wheels to their desired position that might not be on MAX Pattern pitch. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Finish: Black Anodized MAXSpline bore Bearing flange pocket #10 screw clearance…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXSpline-Bearing-Blocks/?sku=REV-21-2551', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/725/images/2984/REV-21-2550-MAXSplineBearingBlock-Hero-FINAL__99173.1692731088.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('#10-32 Standoff - 3/8in Hex - 8.00in - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-2553-PK4', '#10-32 Standoffs are compatible with the REV ION System and provide spacing for mounting key items on your robot. These standoffs are tapped on each end for a #10-32 thread and have a 3/8in flat to flat dimension, similar to a #10-32 nut. Specifications Hex Size: 3/8in Material: Aluminum 6061 Length: Varies Based on Product Selection (see table below) Weights: 0.75in (19.1mm): 3g (0.007lbs) 1.00in (25.4mm): 4g (0.010lbs) 1.25in (31.8mm): 5g (0.01lbs) 1.50in (38.1mm): 7g (0.01lb) 1.75in…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Standoffs/?sku=REV-21-2553-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/680/images/2943/REV-21-2061-2071-10-32Standoffs-Hero-FINAL__93195.1660580019.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
  ('2:1 - Ratio Plate - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2567-PK2', 'Ratio Plates are compatible with the REV ION System. When you need a ratio other than 1:1, Ratio Plates make it easy to position sprockets and pulleys at the perfect center-to-center distance for the given ratio and length of #25 chain or RT25 belt. Each ratio plate is designed for the indicated sprocket or pulley combination and a loop of chain or belt that is the indicated length. For example, 56PL equates to a 56 link loop of #25 chain or a 56 tooth RT25 belt. Specifications Material:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ratio-plates/?sku=REV-21-2567-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/676/images/3009/REV-21-2567-2576-RatioPlates-Hero-FINAL__06234.1666892727.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('3:1 - Ratio Plate - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2574-PK2', 'Ratio Plates are compatible with the REV ION System. When you need a ratio other than 1:1, Ratio Plates make it easy to position sprockets and pulleys at the perfect center-to-center distance for the given ratio and length of #25 chain or RT25 belt. Each ratio plate is designed for the indicated sprocket or pulley combination and a loop of chain or belt that is the indicated length. For example, 56PL equates to a 56 link loop of #25 chain or a 56 tooth RT25 belt. Specifications Material:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ratio-plates/?sku=REV-21-2574-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/676/images/3009/REV-21-2567-2576-RatioPlates-Hero-FINAL__06234.1666892727.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('4:1 - Ratio Plate - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2575-PK2', 'Ratio Plates are compatible with the REV ION System. When you need a ratio other than 1:1, Ratio Plates make it easy to position sprockets and pulleys at the perfect center-to-center distance for the given ratio and length of #25 chain or RT25 belt. Each ratio plate is designed for the indicated sprocket or pulley combination and a loop of chain or belt that is the indicated length. For example, 56PL equates to a 56 link loop of #25 chain or a 56 tooth RT25 belt. Specifications Material:…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ratio-plates/?sku=REV-21-2575-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/676/images/3009/REV-21-2567-2576-RatioPlates-Hero-FINAL__06234.1666892727.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shaft Collar - 2 Piece - Aluminum', 'REV-21-2581', 'MAXSpline Shaft Collars provide mechanical retention for components mounted on MAXSpline Shaft and use a two piece aluminum clamping design for secure attachment. Both versions are black anodized for durability and integrate cleanly within the REV ION System. The narrow profile collar is intended for applications with strict space or weight constraints. It uses M3 hardware to minimize overall size, resulting in a 0.25in wide collar with a 1.88in outer diameter. Its compact geometry allows it…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-MAXSpline-Shaft-Collars?sku=REV-21-2581', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/691/images/3842/REV-21-2581-3476_ShaftCollarFinaly_Edited_FINAL__69187.1780433549.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Shaft Endcap - 1/2in Hex - Aluminum - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2589-PK2', 'MAXSpline Shaft Endcaps are compatible with the REV ION System and transform your MAXSpline Shaft extrusion into a live axle driven by a 1/2in Hex shaft. MAXSpline Shaft Endcaps come in two different materials: a durable plastic version and an upgraded aluminum version. The aluminum endcaps were developed for teams seeking robust solutions for higher-torque applications. *Please note, these endcaps are for use with the MAXSpline Shaft and are not MAXHubs. Specifications MAXSpline Shaft Endcap…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxspline-shaft-endcaps/?sku=REV-21-2589-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/806/images/3191/REV-21-0000-MAXSplineShaftEndCap-FamilyHero-FINAL__00123.1701876940.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('#10-32 Ball Joint Rod End - Right-hand Threaded - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2596-PK2', '#10-32 Ball Joint Rod Ends are compatible with the REV ION System. Right-hand threaded rod ends tighten when turned clockwise while left-handed threaded rod ends tighten when turned counterclockwise. Specifications Type: Stud-type Rod End Ball Joint Thread Size: 10-32 Material: Steel Documentation ION Build System Guide Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-21-2596-PK2 #10-32 Ball Joint Rod End - Right-hand Threaded - 2 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-21-2597-PK2 #10-32 Ball…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Ball-Joint-Rod-Ends/?sku=REV-21-2596-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/750/images/3024/REV-21-2596-2597-BallJointRodEnds-Family-FINAL__61198.1668111921.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('#10-32 Ball Joint Rod End - Left-hand Threaded - 2 Pack', 'REV-21-2597-PK2', '#10-32 Ball Joint Rod Ends are compatible with the REV ION System. Right-hand threaded rod ends tighten when turned clockwise while left-handed threaded rod ends tighten when turned counterclockwise. Specifications Type: Stud-type Rod End Ball Joint Thread Size: 10-32 Material: Steel Documentation ION Build System Guide Product Options SKU PRODUCT NAME CAD & DRAWINGS REV-21-2596-PK2 #10-32 Ball Joint Rod End - Right-hand Threaded - 2 Pack STEP FILE ONSHAPE DRAWING REV-21-2597-PK2 #10-32 Ball…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Ball-Joint-Rod-Ends/?sku=REV-21-2597-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/750/images/3024/REV-21-2596-2597-BallJointRodEnds-Family-FINAL__61198.1668111921.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('#25 Chain Turnbuckle', 'REV-21-2617', 'The #25 Chain Turnbuckle is compatible with both the REV ION System and REV DUO System. It is designed to adjust the length of a #25 Chain by replacing a few links in a run and also allows the user to tension the chain by adjusting the turnbuckle. The turnbuckle is typically attached with a connecting link on either side. They are typically used for linear motion applications (like elevators) or rotating applications that don''t need a full rotation (like arms or virtual 4-bars). one(21) side of…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2617/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/761/images/3089/REV-21-2617-25ChainTurnbuckle-Hero-FINAL__46220.1673990515.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV DUO / Hardware & Tools / Fasteners', 'rev'),
  ('MAXLift End-mount Bearing Block', 'REV-21-2618', 'The MAXLift Bearing Blocks are integral components of the MAXLift system, providing teams with a robust and space-efficient solution for building high-performance elevator assemblies. With the main blocks being designed around billet aluminum construction, these bearing blocks deliver unmatched durability while reducing stage offset spacing to just 0.25 inches enabling more volumetrically efficient lifts. This compact design enhances elevator stability and allows for precise on-pitch…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXLift-Bearing-Blocks/?sku=REV-21-2618', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/873/images/3580/REV-21-2600-MAXLiftBearingBlocks-FamilyHero-FINAL__21159.1760539077.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('MAXLift Face-mount Bearing Block', 'REV-21-2634', 'The MAXLift Bearing Blocks are integral components of the MAXLift system, providing teams with a robust and space-efficient solution for building high-performance elevator assemblies. With the main blocks being designed around billet aluminum construction, these bearing blocks deliver unmatched durability while reducing stage offset spacing to just 0.25 inches enabling more volumetrically efficient lifts. This compact design enhances elevator stability and allows for precise on-pitch…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXLift-Bearing-Blocks/?sku=REV-21-2634', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/873/images/3580/REV-21-2600-MAXLiftBearingBlocks-FamilyHero-FINAL__21159.1760539077.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Clamping Elevator Bearing Block - 2PK', 'REV-21-2636-PK2', 'The Elevator Bearing Blocks family offers reliable, versatile solutions for creating linear motion in elevator systems using MAXTube. Both the original Elevator Bearing Block and the Clamping Elevator Bearing Block provide teams with the flexibility to design efficient, high-performance elevators within the REV ION Build System. The Clamping Elevator Bearing Block (REV-21-2636) improves upon the original design. Clamping onto the sides of MAXTube, it enables mounting along any length of a 1in…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/Elevator-Bearing-Blocks/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/653/images/3453/REV-21-2636-ClampingElevatorBearingBlock-ApplicationExample-FINAL__81328.1734474860.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / FRC Voucher', 'rev'),
  ('4in - 1/2in Hex - 2F - Soft - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-2704-PK4', 'ION Flap Wheels are designed for intakes and conveyance that need reliable performance when interacting with irregular or variable gamepieces. Similar to compliant wheels, they provide a flexible interface, but their flap-based design introduces intentional slip between the wheel and the gamepiece. This helps smooth out transitions, reduce jams, and improve handling consistency across a wide range of shapes and materials. Each wheel is built from a durable polypropylene core with flexible TPR…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-flap-wheels/?sku=REV-21-2704-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/805/images/3707/REV-21-6559-67-68_FlapWheel-FAMILY-FINAL__78500.1765235045.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('4in - 1/2in Hex - 2F - Medium - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-2705-PK4', 'ION Flap Wheels are designed for intakes and conveyance that need reliable performance when interacting with irregular or variable gamepieces. Similar to compliant wheels, they provide a flexible interface, but their flap-based design introduces intentional slip between the wheel and the gamepiece. This helps smooth out transitions, reduce jams, and improve handling consistency across a wide range of shapes and materials. Each wheel is built from a durable polypropylene core with flexible TPR…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-flap-wheels/?sku=REV-21-2705-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/805/images/3707/REV-21-6559-67-68_FlapWheel-FAMILY-FINAL__78500.1765235045.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('4in - 1/2in Hex - 2F - Hard - 4 Pack', 'REV-21-2706-PK4', 'ION Flap Wheels are designed for intakes and conveyance that need reliable performance when interacting with irregular or variable gamepieces. Similar to compliant wheels, they provide a flexible interface, but their flap-based design introduces intentional slip between the wheel and the gamepiece. This helps smooth out transitions, reduce jams, and improve handling consistency across a wide range of shapes and materials. Each wheel is built from a durable polypropylene core with flexible TPR…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ion-flap-wheels/?sku=REV-21-2706-PK4', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/805/images/3707/REV-21-6559-67-68_FlapWheel-FAMILY-FINAL__78500.1765235045.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Launcher', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube Endcap - 2x1', 'REV-21-2710', 'MAXTube Endcaps are designed for seamless integration with the REV ION System, providing a simple and effective solution for joining two or more MAXTube extrusions. These endcaps are pre-tapped for #10-32 hardware, ensuring quick assembly and reliable connections. Machined from durable billet aluminum and finished with a sleek black anodized coating, MAXTube Endcaps are available in various sizes and shapes to fit every style of MAXTube. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Finish: Black…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-Endcaps/?sku=REV-21-2710', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/724/images/2917/REV-21-2710-2712-MAXTubePlug-Hero-FINAL__65673.1659452519.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube Endcap - 2x1 Light', 'REV-21-2711', 'MAXTube Endcaps are designed for seamless integration with the REV ION System, providing a simple and effective solution for joining two or more MAXTube extrusions. These endcaps are pre-tapped for #10-32 hardware, ensuring quick assembly and reliable connections. Machined from durable billet aluminum and finished with a sleek black anodized coating, MAXTube Endcaps are available in various sizes and shapes to fit every style of MAXTube. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Finish: Black…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-Endcaps/?sku=REV-21-2711', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/724/images/2917/REV-21-2710-2712-MAXTubePlug-Hero-FINAL__65673.1659452519.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube Endcap - 1x1', 'REV-21-2712', 'MAXTube Endcaps are designed for seamless integration with the REV ION System, providing a simple and effective solution for joining two or more MAXTube extrusions. These endcaps are pre-tapped for #10-32 hardware, ensuring quick assembly and reliable connections. Machined from durable billet aluminum and finished with a sleek black anodized coating, MAXTube Endcaps are available in various sizes and shapes to fit every style of MAXTube. Specifications Material: Aluminum 6061 Finish: Black…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/MAXTube-Endcaps/?sku=REV-21-2712', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/724/images/2917/REV-21-2710-2712-MAXTubePlug-Hero-FINAL__65673.1659452519.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube Internal Support - 2x1 - 30 Pack', 'REV-21-2715-PK30', 'MAXTube Internal Supports are compatible with the REV ION System and facilitate bolt-through assembly within a MAXTube without causing permanent deformation. Crucial for ensuring structurally sound through-bolted joints and allows multiple supports to be seamlessly slid into a MAXTube to accommodate multiple screws. Features Clearance for #10 screws Provides screw placement in any available hole within MAXTube Thin profile allows for multiple to be used on adjacent holes Specifications…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxtube-internal-supports/?sku=REV-21-2715-PK30', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/819/images/3475/MAXTube_Internal_Support-HERO__14979.1739308563.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube Internal Support - 2x1 Light - 30 Pack', 'REV-21-2716-PK30', 'MAXTube Internal Supports are compatible with the REV ION System and facilitate bolt-through assembly within a MAXTube without causing permanent deformation. Crucial for ensuring structurally sound through-bolted joints and allows multiple supports to be seamlessly slid into a MAXTube to accommodate multiple screws. Features Clearance for #10 screws Provides screw placement in any available hole within MAXTube Thin profile allows for multiple to be used on adjacent holes Specifications…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxtube-internal-supports/?sku=REV-21-2716-PK30', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/819/images/3475/MAXTube_Internal_Support-HERO__14979.1739308563.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('MAXTube Internal Support - 1x1 - 30 Pack', 'REV-21-2717-PK30', 'MAXTube Internal Supports are compatible with the REV ION System and facilitate bolt-through assembly within a MAXTube without causing permanent deformation. Crucial for ensuring structurally sound through-bolted joints and allows multiple supports to be seamlessly slid into a MAXTube to accommodate multiple screws. Features Clearance for #10 screws Provides screw placement in any available hole within MAXTube Thin profile allows for multiple to be used on adjacent holes Specifications…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/maxtube-internal-supports/?sku=REV-21-2717-PK30', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/819/images/3475/MAXTube_Internal_Support-HERO__14979.1739308563.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Drivetrain', 'rev'),
  ('Linear Actuator - 12in Stroke', 'REV-21-2735', 'The Linear Actuator - 12in Stroke is compatible with the REV ION System. This electric linear actuator aligns seamlessly with FRC-legal motors and gearboxes while adhering to FRC hardware and mounting standards. Designed for adaptability, this actuator accommodates both gearbox and 1:1 motor configurations, catering to varying force requirements dictated by different applications. Its versatility extends to climbing tasks, driving arms, actuating intakes, and deploying other diverse…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2735/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/813/images/3208/REV-21-2735-LinearActuatorKit-12inStroke-Hero-FINAL__84279.1703774115.500.500.png?c=2', 'Competition / FIRST Robotics Competition / Motion / Gearboxes', 'rev'),
  ('MAXSpline Pillow Block', 'REV-21-2750', 'The MAXSpline Pillow Block is compatible with the REV ION System and allows for MAXSpline Shaft (REV-21-2520) to be rigidly mounted to any surface featuring a 2in mounting hole pattern. This enables easy attachment to rotating high torque applications. Working especially well with the MAX 180 Degree Gearbox (REV-25-2741) attached to a Linear Actuator (REV-21-2735), the MAXSpline Pillow Block offers an offset to keep clear of other mounting hardware or retained shafts. The small notch, located…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2750/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/826/images/3333/REV-21-2750-MAXSplinePillowBlock-Hero-FINAL__22479.1727128869.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot', 'rev'),
  ('Universal Motor Bracket', 'REV-21-2804-PK2', 'These ION Motor Brackets are compatible with the REV ION System. The ION UltraPlanetary Face Mount Bracket (REV-21-2046) allows for easy mounting of our UltraPlanetary Gearbox to any of our MAXTube products. Each plate features 2x #10-32 tapped inserts for straightforward mounting on any structure. The MAXSpline Bracket - Motor Mount - Flat (REV-21-2360) facilitates quick mounting of motors or gearboxes with a 2in bolt pattern to MAXTubing or structures. It includes a MAXSpline Bore for…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/ION-Motor-Brackets/?sku=REV-21-2804-PK2', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/868/images/3454/ION_Motor_Brackets-Family-Hero-FINAL__60886.1734558475.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Structure', 'rev'),
  ('0.5in - #10-32 Shaft End Screw V2 - 25 Pack', 'REV-21-2805-PK25', '#10-32 Shaft End Screw V1 and V2 are compatible with the REV ION System and are used to retain parts on any ION hex shaft instead of shaft collars. 1/2in Rounded Hex Shafts in various lengths are available and come tapped with #10-32 holes. The integrated flange of the Shaft End Screw is larger than the outside diameter of the 1/2in hex and will keep motion components from sliding off the end of the shaft. All Shaft End Screws also feature a nylon patch on the threads making them self-locking…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/10-32-Shaft-End-Screws/?sku=REV-21-2805-PK25', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/870/images/3444/REV-21-3700-ShaftEndScrewV2-FamilyHero-FINAL__98164.1734046171.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / REV ION FRC Starter Bot / Conveyor', 'rev'),
  ('Vortex Shaft - 8mm', 'REV-21-2807', 'The 8mm Vortex Shaft, compatible with the REV ION System, empowers you to utilize the NEO Vortex Brushless Motor with any 8mm keyed shaft component. This interchangeability also means that the NEO Vortex matches the output of a NEO Brushless Motor V1.1, making it a seamless drop-in replacement for your designs. Featuring a 1/2in hex section that drives the shaft and a built-in taper for effortless self-centering, much like a milling machine. When you secure the shaft using a #10-32 Shaft End…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/rev-21-2807/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/809/images/3204/REV-21-2807-NEOVortexShaft8mm-FINAL__71506.1700160299.1280.1280__13655.1703701173.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / Brushless / NEO Vortex & SPARK Flex', 'rev'),
  ('1/2in Rounded Hex Shaft - 1.0in - Tapped', 'REV-21-2809', '1/2in Rounded Hex Shafts are compatible with the REV ION System and are a ready-to-use length of hex shaft that have been cut to length and have the ends tapped. The ends are tapped #10-32 in order to accept a screw and washer or shaft collar. The 1/2in hex is compatible with the shaft retention method of the MAXPlanetary output stage. The 1/2in Rounded Hex Shaft - 36in is not tapped. Note for (REV-21-1135) 1/2in Rounded Hex Shaft - 36.0in (not tapped): Our 1/2" Rounded Hex Shafts are…', 'REV Robotics', null, true, 'https://www.revrobotics.com/.5in-Rounded-Hex-Shafts/?sku=REV-21-2809', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-t3eo8vwp22/products/675/images/2948/REV-21-0000-2809-2823-0.5inRoundedHexShaft-FamilyHero-FINAL__95578.1660668305.500.500.png?c=2', 'REV ION / FRC Everybot', 'rev'),
